## roll_within_bounds

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl roll_within_bounds max rolls =\n    inl power = listm.length rolls - 1\n    match accumulate_dice_rolls rolls power 0 with\n    | Some (result, _) when result >= 1 && result <= max => Some result\n    | _ => None","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl roll_within_bounds max rolls =
      inl power = listm.length rolls - 1
      match accumulate_dice_rolls rolls power 0 with
      | Some (result, _) when result >= 1 && result <= max => Some result
      | _ => None
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

