## calculate_dice_count

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl calculate_dice_count forall a {number} b {number}. (max : a) : b =\n    inl rec body forall t {number}. (n : t) (p : a) : t =\n        inl return () =\n            trace Debug\n                fun () => \"dice.calculate_dice_count\"\n                fun () => { max p n }\n            n\n        if p < max then\n            if p > (limit.max : a) / 6\n            then failwith (\"dice.calculate_dice_count / max: \" ++# #?max ++# \" is above the largest supported bound \" ++# #?p)\n            else 루프 (n + 1) (p * 6)\n        else return ()\n    and inl 루프 forall t {number}. (n : t) (p : a) : t =\n        if var_is max |> not\n        then body n p\n        else\n            inl n = dyn n\n            inl p = dyn p\n            join body n p\n    if max = 1\n    then 1\n    else 루프 0 1","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl calculate_dice_count forall a {number} b {number}. (max : a) : b =
      inl rec body forall t {number}. (n : t) (p : a) : t =
          inl return () =
              trace Debug
                  fun () => "dice.calculate_dice_count"
                  fun () => { max p n }
              n
          if p < max then
              if p > (limit.max : a) / 6
              then failwith ("dice.calculate_dice_count / max: " ++# #?max ++# " is above the largest supported bound " ++# #?p)
              else 루프 (n + 1) (p * 6)
          else return ()
      and inl 루프 forall t {number}. (n : t) (p : a) : t =
          if var_is max |> not
          then body n p
          else
              inl n = dyn n
              inl p = dyn p
              join body n p
      if max = 1
      then 1
      else 루프 0 1
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

